#: package/analyses/contTablesPaired.description
#: contTablesPaired/options.description.main
msgid ""
"McNemar's test for paired binary data, extended with a paired odds ratio and "
"difference in proportions (with confidence intervals), marginal percentages, "
"agreement/kappa, and — for RxR tables — Bowker's test of symmetry and the "
"Stuart-Maxwell test of marginal homogeneity."
msgstr ""
"El test de McNemar para datos binarios pareados, ampliado con una razón de "
"odds pareada y diferencia de proporciones (con intervalos de confianza), "
"porcentajes marginales, concordancia/kappa, y — para tablas RxR — la prueba "
"de simetría de Bowker y la prueba de homogeneidad marginal de Stuart-Maxwell."

